stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft: Written by a person,<br/>or drafted by AI
  Draft --> Reviewed: Admin reviews it
  Reviewed --> Draft: Any edit
  Draft --> Archived
  Reviewed --> Archived
  Reviewed --> Following: Engineer starts it
  state Following {
    direction LR
    [*] --> Step1
    Step1 --> Step2: Done or skipped
    Step2 --> Step3: Done or skipped
    Step3 --> StepN: Done or skipped
    StepN --> [*]: Done or skipped
  }
  Following --> Recorded: Result, helped or not
  Following --> Abandoned: Ended early
  Recorded --> Reviewed: Result counts in its history
  Abandoned --> Reviewed
